The model files describe the behavior and the interface of a device that is
documented in public sources, which docs/references.md lists. The descriptions
and comments in the model files were written for this project. The identifiers
(browse names, node ids, namespace URIs, and the application URI) follow the
documented interface of the imitated device so that existing OPC UA clients
recognize the simulator; a URI that names a Siemens domain identifies that
interface and is not a claim of origin.

